            "4. Divide (/)\n",
            "5. Exit\n",
            "Enter choice (1-5): 3\n",
            "Enter first number: 4\n",
            "Enter second number: 5\n",
            "\n",
            "Result: 4.0 * 5.0 = 20.0\n",
